{"id":"vod_sn_36794","vodId":"36794","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"莎木","name_cn":"莎木","date":"2022-01-01","year":"2022","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/985e987b3b6b903a0d268656d0dab65e.jpg"},"summary":"《莎木》是1999年在Dreamcast推出的游戏系列。凉是本故事的男主角。他出生于日本的横须贺。他的母亲在他三岁就去逝了，因此由父亲芭月巌抚养成人，当然直到父亲被蓝帝所杀。他和他家名叫福生的门卫在一起，福生同时也是他父亲的学生。凉从小就开始训练芭月流的武艺。这样的训练使他长得很强壮，武德兼备。虽然他对武学很热衷，但他没有想过成为像他父亲那样的武学大师。在打斗中凉知道如何运用所学。同时他当熟悉横须贺的地理环境。尽管凉生性固执，好胜心强，但做事会三思而后行。一个很明显的例子，尽管他知道原崎望对他有好感，但是他藏在心里，对原崎望相当冷淡。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:46:11","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qyUdHVz4vD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JCjQ2nwcfE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/T9XXBmqzcZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/t2tRBTcc9t1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MSa180BVrV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zHn0mJRCMr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/p5rBT9C8Jk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JYZ2SjbvfC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hv7v3AMnWz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EKFDtTwE9d1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6ahPQe0hzm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hkqSMrHDT51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7wcbYGJyrh1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:18.802Z"}